      "title": "Decision Rule",
      "items": [
        "Attributes are compared in order from 1 (Weight) to 11 (Neighbor IP)",
        "The first attribute whose values differ immediately decides the best route (differs → select)",
        "If the values tie, evaluation moves on to the next attribute (tie → next step)"
